  Description: Stream a Lens scene to iPhones that watch it in AR. ARKit Spectator creates a Snap Cloud room with a 4-digit code and publishes the poses of chosen SceneObjects (plus optional glTF models and custom JSON). The included iOS app joins by code, places the scene on a real surface and renders it read-only.
